the target language is: lps.

% Inform's "MRE" (Future events), in Logical English. See lps/mre.lps for the
% two findings: story time is a fluent, and a turn has an end.

the maximum time is 60.

the events are:
    the command is to eat *a thing*; known as cmd_eat.
    the command is to wait; known as cmd_wait.
    the turn ends; known as end_turn.
    *a person* consumes *a thing*; known as consume.

the actions are:
    *a person* takes *a thing*; known as take.
    *a person* eats *a thing*; known as eat.
    *a note* is said at turn *a number*; known as say.
    *a person* starves; known as starve.

the fluents are:
    the turn is *a number*; known as turn.
    *a person* is hungry; known as hungry.
    *a person* carries *a thing*; known as carries.
    *a thing* is at *a place*; known as at.
    hunger of *a person* is due at turn *a number*; known as hunger_due.
    starvation of *a person* is due at turn *a number*; known as starvation_due.
    *a person* is dead; known as dead.

the templates are:
    *a thing* is food.
    *a thing* satisfies for *a number* turns.

the knowledge base mre includes:

initially the turn is 0
    and player is hungry
    and player is at larder
    and apple is at larder
    and candy is at larder
    and pasta is at larder.

apple is food.
candy is food.
pasta is food.
apple satisfies for 2 turns.
candy satisfies for 5 turns.
pasta satisfies for 125 turns.

% the clock: every command is a turn
when the command is to eat a thing
then the turn that is a number becomes number + 1.

when the command is to wait
then the turn that is a number becomes number + 1.

when a person takes a thing
then the person carries the thing.

when a person takes a thing
then it is not the case that the thing is at a place.

when a person eats a thing
then it is not the case that the person carries the thing.

when a person eats a thing
then it is not the case that the person is hungry.

% "hunger resumes in the satisfaction period of the noun from now"
when a person eats a thing
    and the turn is a number
    and the thing satisfies for a period turns
    and a due = number + period
then hunger of the person is due at turn the due.

when a person starves
then the person is dead.

it must not be true that
    a person eats a thing from a first time to a second time
    and it is not the case that the person carries the thing at the first time.

it must not be true that
    a person eats a thing from a first time to a second time
    and it is not the case that the thing is food.

% "(first taking the apple)": the implicit take is a composite event
if the command is to eat a thing from a first time to a second time
    and player is hungry at the second time
then player consumes the thing from the second time to a third time.

if the command is to eat a thing from a first time to a second time
    and it is not the case that player is hungry at the second time
    and the turn is a number at the second time
then not_hungry is said at turn the number from the second time to a third time.

a person consumes a thing from a first time to a second time if
    the person carries the thing at the first time
    and the person eats the thing from the first time to the second time.

a person consumes a thing from a first time to a third time if
    it is not the case that the person carries the thing at the first time
    and the person takes the thing from the first time to a second time
    and the person eats the thing from the second time to the third time.

% "Every turn when the player is hungry" — at the end of the turn
if the turn ends from a first time to a second time
    and player is hungry at the second time
    and the turn is a number at the second time
    and it is not the case that player is dead at the second time
then complaint is said at turn the number from the second time to a third time.

% "At the time when hunger resumes"
if the turn ends from a first time to a second time
    and hunger of a person is due at turn a number at the second time
    and the turn is the number at the second time
    and a later = number + 3
then terminate hunger of the person is due at turn the number from the second time to a third time
    and initiate the person is hungry from the second time to the third time
    and initiate starvation of the person is due at turn the later from the second time to the third time.

% "At the time when starvation occurs: if the player is hungry, end the story"
if the turn ends from a first time to a second time
    and starvation of a person is due at turn a number at the second time
    and the turn is the number at the second time
    and the person is hungry at the second time
then the person starves from the second time to a third time
    and terminate starvation of the person is due at turn the number from the second time to the third time.

if the turn ends from a first time to a second time
    and starvation of a person is due at turn a number at the second time
    and the turn is the number at the second time
    and it is not the case that the person is hungry at the second time
then terminate starvation of the person is due at turn the number from the second time to a third time.

scenario one is:
    the command is to eat apple from 1 to 2.
    the turn ends from 4 to 5.
    the command is to wait from 5 to 6.
    the turn ends from 8 to 9.
    the command is to wait from 9 to 10.
    the turn ends from 12 to 13.
    the command is to wait from 13 to 14.
    the turn ends from 16 to 17.
    the command is to eat candy from 17 to 18.
    the turn ends from 20 to 21.
    the command is to wait from 21 to 22.
    the turn ends from 24 to 25.
    the command is to wait from 25 to 26.
    the turn ends from 28 to 29.
    the command is to wait from 29 to 30.
    the turn ends from 32 to 33.
    the command is to wait from 33 to 34.
    the turn ends from 36 to 37.
    the command is to wait from 37 to 38.
    the turn ends from 40 to 41.
    the command is to wait from 41 to 42.
    the turn ends from 44 to 45.
    the command is to wait from 45 to 46.
    the turn ends from 48 to 49.
    the command is to wait from 49 to 50.
    the turn ends from 52 to 53.
    the command is to wait from 53 to 54.
    the turn ends from 56 to 57.
